      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Some questions hide speed inside repeated leaps.\n\nSpeed depends on two things:\nleaps per unit time × length of each leap.\n\nIf a dog takes 4 leaps while a hare takes 5, but each dog leap is 4 units and each hare leap is 3 units, speeds are 16 : 15.",
